I have noticed a problem with this game.

When you select a tile on the third level, it seems to rotate the
graphics for that region to the right, and you end up with a really
screwed up display, again, just in that region. It looks like the
tile that is meant to be there, and the tile to its left are
superimposed. If you redraw the window, it corrects itself, and I
have only seen this happen to the tiles on the third level (the
level that starts with just 4 tiles on it), and it always happens to
these tiles.

My server is PC-Xsight running on an AT with EGA.

If anyone else has noticed (or better yet fixed) this problem,
please send me some mail.

